t` 15s is server-internal only. FIX: LEAN pipeline by default in `core/adaptive_rag.py` —\n`build_adaptive_rag_graph(self_check=False)` → router→retrieve→grade→generate→END (3 calls); `run_adaptive_rag` defaults\n`max_retries=0, self_check=False` (loops/self-checks opt-in). Synced per-user+template bundles. Lean may STILL be slow if\ngemma ignores no-think → recommend a smaller chat model. Not fully re-verified (classifier outage cut final test).\nkg3d.cache \"unable to open database file\" = noise; `/api/rag/indexing-manifest` 500 in exe run = unfinished thread.\n\n**Workflow designer Phase 1 (library) — 2026-06-20.** User wants every workflow visible/manageable like Benny Studio.\nBackend was already COMPLETE: `/api/workflows/workflows` (GET list merges `benny/examples/workflows/`=templates\n[basic_chat, frolov-ai-analysis] + `<bundle>/workspace/workflows/`=user; GET/{id}; POST save-by-id; DELETE) via\n`persistence/workflow_storage.py`. The visual designer exists ONLY in the non-vendored React app\n`runtime/frontend/src/components/Studio/{WorkflowCanvas,NodePalette,ManifestCanvas}.tsx`. Shell \"Flows\" only did\nplan→run. User chose PHASED. PHASE 1 BUILT (Alpine, Bridge Flows panel): backend +`description` on `WorkflowDefinition`\n(workflow_routes.py). bridge.js: module helper `workflowToDag` (stored nodes/edges → dag.canvas mode:\"workflow\",\nauto-layout); state workflows/selectedWorkflow/workflowDraft/workflowEditing; loadWorkflows/openWorkflow/renderWorkflowDag\n(into existing `flowsDag` ref)/newWorkflow/cloneWorkflow/saveWorkflow/deleteWorkflow/workflowEditable. view.html:\n\"Workflows\" library card atop Flows panel (Template|Yours badges, New/Refresh, Clone/Edit/Save + JSON textarea editor).\nbridge.css `.ps-bridge__wflib*`. Paths: `runtimeFetch(\"/workflows/workflows\")` (router double-mounted at /api/workflows).\nVERIFIED live: list 2 templates + save→get(desc persists)→delete round-trip OK; node --check + py_compile pass; synced\nper-user+template bundle