{"parentUuid":"2cd5f479-b8ac-4510-929d-55798c41fefa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01L44bJ2aLxnDe4AqpSxdeqQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This was the big one. Here's the full picture.\n\n## The root cause you suspected — found it\nYour shell is **1.4.7** but your runtime is **1.4.5**. You updated the app, but **none of the v1.4.6/v1.4.7 fixes were ever actually running.** The reason:\n\n```js\nif (!isBundleComplete(bundleDir) && ...) fetch()   // ← version-BLIND\n```\n\n`isBundleComplete` only checks that `python/benny/neo4j/jre` *exist* — not the version. So an intact older bundle satisfied it, the version-aware re-fetch was never called, and **deleting the dir was the only way to force a refresh** (it made the bundle \"incomplete\"). That's why this kept repeating.\n\n## The fix (PR [#29](https://github.com/binary16labs/prime-silo/pull/29) → v1.4.8)\n1. **Version-aware gate:** the supervisor now fetches when the bundle is missing **or** the marker version ≠ app version. `isBundleComplete` is kept only for \"can we run offline\" graceful degrade.\n2. **Lock-safe install:** instead of `rmSync(destDir)` in place (which throws mid-delete when `java`/Neo4j holds a lock → the corrupt half-bundle you had to clean up), it now extracts to a `.staging` dir and **renames it into place** (a dir rename works even with locked files inside). Old bundle is moved aside and pruned best-effort; on failure the existing bundle stays intact.\n\nVerified with a standalone harness: mismatch→fetch, match→no-op, marker updates, leftovers pruned.\n\n## What this means for you\n- **Install v1.4.8** (building now). Its fixed gate will see marker `1.4.5` ≠ `1.4.8` and **auto-fetch the 1.4.8 runtime** — which is cumulative, so it brings **ingest + graph + triple-parse fixes all live in one update**. No manual deletion.\n- Quit from the tray before installing (clean lock release), then launch. That single update should both prove the gate fix and finally make all the prior fixes real.\n\nAfter it lands I can re-verify the marker flips to `1.4.8` and probe the graph/ingest endpoints to confirm everything's genuinely live this time. Want me to do that once you've installed it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1625,"cache_read_input_tokens":412257,"output_tokens":769,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1625,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":412257,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1625,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1625},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcVZo9zZmJhr2N9dGhYRQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"40e8b1e0-17c8-4ec7-a834-e45f9ee0e913","timestamp":"2026-06-28T11:18:58.680Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo","sessionId":"b5bb1984-4ef6-4dd6-8984-6e589fd772ec","version":"2.1.187","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
